hought","house":"rhino","text":"Orchid has sent a TRUCE, which is in effect. My doctrine requires holding the middle ford (F2) with all foot, and elephants at F1. I will reinforce F2 and maintain the posture."},{"seq":664,"t":3900,"type":"courier","id":"c214","house":"rhino","letter":"L262","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":4200,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"BEQRT BKKT, DKHS MT IESSHA BKQS."},{"seq":665,"t":3900,"type":"courier","id":"c215","house":"rhino","letter":"L263","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village"],"depart":4200,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RANKJS BKKT, DKHS MT IESSHA BKQS."},{"seq":666,"t":3900,"type":"courier","id":"c216","house":"rhino","letter":"L264","kind":"order","to":"rhino-ele-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":4200,"plain":"ELEPHANTS, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"AHALDMJTR, DKHS MT WART BKQS."},{"seq":667,"t":3900,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1639,"retries":0},{"seq":668,"t":3900,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 14. My doctrine is to take the east ford early and hold it. Kite infantry and archers are already at F3 (East Ford). I will use my cavalry to support this and reinforce the position, following the doctrine's preference for speed and road movement."},{"seq":669,"t":3900,"type":"courier","id":"c217","house":"kite","letter":"L265","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":3900,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":670,"t":3900,"type":"courier","id":"c218","house":"kite","letter":"L266","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":3900,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO NORTH BANK EAST.","cipher":null},{"seq":671,"t":3900,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1759,"retries":0},{"seq":672,"t":3900,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino tr